#AREA The Sun Dome~
#AUTHORS Tanis  ~





#HELPS
-1 SUNDOME~
The Sun Dome, levels 40 - 95

 The Sun Dome is located east from Ocean City. It's a temple of Order
founded before the great Order/Chaos war and has been a sanctuary for
Order followers ever since. A couple of years ago the old High Priest 
Toras died of ripe old age and his son, Sa'ar, was elected as the new
High Priest.~
0 $~




#RANGES 40 95 0 99
#FLAGS AFLAG_NODEBUG
#MOBILES
#11600
guard sun dome~
The Sun Dome Guard~
There's a Sun Dome guard here.~
This is a Sun Dome cityguard. He's wearing golden armor and bears a shield
with the crest of Sun Dome.~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_STAY_AREA|ACT_BODY
AFF_DETECT_INVIS|AFF_INFRARED|AFF_HUNT
0 S
52 0 BODY_HEAD|BODY_TORSO|BODY_LEG|BODY_ARM 40d50+200 2d10+45
25000 287869
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>rand_prog 5~
if rand(50)
  mpecho The Sun reflects from the Sun Dome guard's shield blinding you for a second.
else
  mpecho The Sun Dome guard yawns.
endif
~
|
