#11637
mouth~
The Magic Mouth built into the gate~
Yippee!! an ethereal mob opening doors.~
It's the ethereal that keeps an eye on people entering the city~
ACT_SENTINEL|ACT_SMART|ACT_ONE_FIGHT|ACT_BODY
