everywhere and you occasionally sink in the sand. You should watch out for 
quicksand, it is said to be deadly. The sun blazes mercilessly above your 
head. You can see the edge of the desert to the west. You have a feeling 
that you should leave this god-forsaken place.~
116 ROOM_NO_MOB SECT_DESERT
DDIR_NORTH
You see the desert.~
~
0 -1 11685
DDIR_EAST
You see the desert.~
~
0 -1 11685
DDIR_SOUTH
You see the desert.~
~
0 -1 11689
DDIR_WEST
You see the crossroads.~
~
0 -1 11600
S
